<title>USA: Calpine to build 480 MW plant in Calif..</title>
<headline>Calpine to build 480 MW plant in Calif..</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calpine Corp announced Wednesday plans to develop a 480 megawatt (MW) natural gas-fired power plant in northern California, from which power will be sold directly to wholesale and retail customers.</p>
<p>The proposed facility, Sutter Power Plant, would be adjacent to one of Calpine's plants in Yuba City, Calif.</p>
<p>Calpine expects to begin construction in 1998, with commerical operation starting in 1999.</p>
</text>
